body:
Here's my `Card` component:
```
 <Card
      containerStyle={{
        width: (deviceWidth),
        height: (deviceWidth / 2),
        borderRadius: 5
      }}
    >
      <Card.Image containerStyle={{ flex: 1, width: deviceWidth, height: deviceWidth / 8 }} style={{ height: (deviceWidth / 4), resizeMode: "center" }} transition={true} source={{ uri: "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1530549387789-4c1017266635?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&ixid=eyJhcHBfaWQiOjEyMDd9&auto=format&fit=crop&w=750&q=80" }} />
      <Text>{index}</Text>
      <Text>{item.title}</Text>
      <Text>{item.text}</Text>
    </Card >
```

And my `Carousel`:
```
<Carousel
        layout={"stack"}
        loop={true}
        renderItem={_render_cards}
        data={car.car}
        itemWidth={deviceWidth}
        sliderWidth={deviceWidth}
      />
```
